                                                "sense_id": "47ba85f8-9511-3727-b4ab-6e92887a0e1e",
                                                "text": "And that's not all - the historic timber tea room has been dismantled to allow the platforms to be altered. […] The tea room - one of the few timber station buildings still in front line service - will then be painstakingly rebuilt, but in a slightly different position."
